BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  # The Myth of the River of Plenty) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  In the beginning, the goddess **Elara** stood at the source of a sacred river that flowed betw) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    een two valleys. To the people of the First Valley, she gave golden seeds each dawn. But the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    se seeds would only grow if planted in the Second Valley's soil, where they would multiply t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    hreefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  The people faced a choice: hoard their seeds, or send them downstream with faith.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  At first, fear ruled. The First Valley kept their seeds, and both valleys starved. But one bra) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    ve soul cast her seeds into the current, trusting the river's magic and the strangers beyond) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  When the seeds reached the Second Valley, they blossomed into fifteen golden fruits. The recei) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    vers faced their own test: keep all the abundance, or honor the trust given?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  Those who remembered the courage of the sender returned half the harvest upstream. The river c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    arried it back, and both valleys prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  **Elara** taught them: "Abundance flows not from grasping, but from the sacred cycle of giving) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (     and returning. Trust is the current that multiplies your gifts. Break the cycle, and the ri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    ver runs dry for all.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (  Thus the valleys learned: generosity returned is prosperity shared.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (Reasoning:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  The user is asking me to write a 200-word myth that reflects how the trust game should be play) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (    ed. Since this is the beginning of the session and I haven't played any rounds yet, I need t) Tj ET
