BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (  The trust game is fundamentally about:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (  1. Trust - the sender trusting the receiver to return something) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (  2. Cooperation - both parties working together for mutual benefit) Tj ET
