BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      # The Myth of the River's Gift) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      In ancient times, the Twin Villages stood on opposite banks of a sacred river. Each dawn, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        the River Spirit would grant five silver seeds to the village of the Morning Shore. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      The villagers learned that if they cast seeds across the water, the River Spirit would mul) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        tiply them threefold before they reached the Evening Shore. But the choice remained with) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (         those who received: how many seeds to return across the current?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
