BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    In ancient times, the Twin Villages stood on opposite banks of a sacred river. Each dawn, th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      e River Spirit would grant five silver seeds to the village of the Morning Shore. ) Tj ET
