BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      Each season, the Mountain folk faced a choice: pour their precious water down into the val) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (        ley below, trusting it would somehow return to them, or keep it for themselves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      One brave elder named Kiva decided to pour half the spring's bounty into the valley. As th) Tj ET
