BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        teen silver drops, more wealth than she had ever known in a single moment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      The River faced her choice: keep this abundance, or return some to the Rain who had truste) Tj ET
