BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      But greed whispered to the Second Village: "Keep it all." They did. The next dawn, the Fir) Tj ET
