BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      Myth: In the beginning, the Goddess of the Valley created a bridge between two lands. She ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        whispered to Hana, "What you offer across this bridge will bloom threefold in your neigh) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        bor's hands.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      Hana stood at the bridge's edge, clutching five stones of light-all she possessed. The old) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (         stories warned of those who crossed with empty hands, and those who hoarded what they r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        eceived. Yet Hana remembered: abundance cannot be born from fear.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      She released all five stones. They tumbled across the bridge, multiplying as they rolled, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        arriving as fifteen in Dorian's garden. Now the bridge waited, humming with ancient ener) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        gy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      The Goddess watched. The true magic was not in the multiplication alone, but in the sacred) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (         pattern it could weave. If Dorian honored the gift with fair return, a cycle would begi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        n-trust answered with trust, generosity with generosity. The bridge would strengthen wit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        h each crossing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      But if one crossing prospered while the other wilted, the bridge would remember. It would ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        know whether multiplication served both sides or enriched only one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      Hana waited by the bridge, having poured forth all her light. The next move belonged to Do) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        rian, and in that choice, the future of the valley would be written.) Tj ET
