BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (         guardian. But the magic only worked when the waters flowed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      The Guardian of Return faced a choice: keep all the multiplied silver, or send some back u) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        pstream, defying nature itself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      For many moons, the guardians hoarded their coins, and both lands remained dust. Then one ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        guardian, in faith, cast three coins into the waters. They multiplied to nine. The recei) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        ving guardian, moved by this trust, returned five coins upstream through ancient magic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      Both guardians prospered. The first kept seven coins \(five minus three, plus five returned) Tj ET
