BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        he second would triple in abundance, but only if the second river chose to flow back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      A wanderer named Dorian came upon these rivers and met a stranger there. The gods whispere) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        d, "Pour forth your water, and watch it multiply.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      Dorian hesitated. If he gave generously, the stranger would receive three measures for eac) Tj ET
