BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        us souls and those who hoarded greedily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      Yet Dorian understood: the magic of multiplication existed only through the act of giving.) Tj ET
