BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      In the beginning, there were two rivers flowing through barren lands-the River of Giving a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        nd the River of Return. Each was controlled by a guardian spirit, and neither river coul) Tj ET
