BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      # The Tale of the Twin Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      In the ancient days, two rivers flowed through a parched valley-the River of Offering and ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        the River of Return. The gods declared that any water poured from the first river into t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (        he second would triple in abundance, but only if the second river chose to flow back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      A wanderer named Dorian came upon these rivers and met a stranger there. The gods whispere) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        d, "Pour forth your water, and watch it multiply.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      Dorian hesitated. If he gave generously, the stranger would receive three measures for eac) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        h one poured. But would the stranger let any flow back? The valley had known both genero) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        us souls and those who hoarded greedily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      Yet Dorian understood: the magic of multiplication existed only through the act of giving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (         Without trust extended, there could be no abundance created. And without return, there ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        could be no trust renewed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      The wisest travelers learned that both rivers must flow. When offering flows freely and re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        turn flows fairly, the valley flourishes. When either river runs dry from fear or greed,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (         all suffer drought.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      Thus the gods taught: in the dance between giving and returning, between risk and reciproc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        ity, lies the secret spring that turns scarcity into abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      Here is the myth the other agent wrote in the previous round:) Tj ET
