BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      In the time before memory, there lived two villages separated by a barren valley. Each had) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (         a sacred well that gave water, but the water was precious and scarce.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      One day, a villager named Kira discovered an ancient truth: when water from one well was p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        oured into the valley between them, the ground transformed it threefold before it reache) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        d the other side. But the receiving village alone decided how much to send back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      The first trial, Kira carried a full vessel across the valley. The water multiplied as pro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        mised, filling the other village's reserves. In gratitude, they returned half, and both ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        villages prospered more than before.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      But then came a season when Kira carried only drops, fearing betrayal. The other village r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        eceived little and could return less. Both suffered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      The elders understood: the magic of the valley required courage and reciprocity. When the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (        first village trusted generously, and the second honored that trust with fair return, th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (        e multiplication blessed both sides. The wells never ran dry.) Tj ET
