BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      Each season, the Mountain folk faced a choice: pour their precious water down into the val) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        ley below, trusting it would somehow return to them, or keep it for themselves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
