BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      the perfect halves, balanced as the moon's reflection.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    An elder asked, "Why do you always choose halves when receiving, yet accept less than halves) Tj ET
