BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (       other shows wisdom present from the start.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    Neither superior. Dorian's evolution honored lessons received. Briar's steadiness honored se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      lf-knowledge. Both built trust-one through demonstrated learning, one through reliable pat) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      tern.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    The Circle needs both: those who adapt through experience and those who hold steady across a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ll storms.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  Agent_3 \(Cyra\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    Myth: Cyra waited at the loom as receiver when Hana arrived-a new face, but carrying familia) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      r energy. Without hesitation, Hana released all five threads. Complete trust from a strang) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      er.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    The threads multiplied to fifteen, and Cyra responded as she always did: eight threads retur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ned. Hana profited three; Cyra kept seven. The same measure she'd given Dorian, Finn, Gale) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      n-anyone who offered complete vulnerability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    "You send everything as sender," Cyra observed, recognizing the pattern from Hana's bearing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (       "I send four-fifths. Different measures, yet both consistent.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    Hana nodded. "I've learned that consistency in one's own character matters more than uniform) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ity across all travelers. You give eight to complete trust-that's your authentic rhythm. I) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (       give everything when sending-that's mine.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    "The loom doesn't demand we all weave identically," Cyra agreed. "You embody total release. ) Tj ET
